  <view wx:elif="{{currentView === 'map-reminder'}}" class="page subpage" data-testid="page-map-reminder"><view class="subpage-header"><button class="back-button" bindtap="onBackToMy"><image class="icon icon--back" src="/assets/icons/arrow-left-gray.svg" mode="aspectFit" /></button><text class="subpage-title">提醒设置</text></view><scroll-view class="method-scroll" scroll-y scroll-top="{{reminderScrollTop}}" data-scroll-key="reminderScrollTop" bindscrollend="onRememberScrollEnd"><view class="method-card light-capsule"><image src="/assets/icons/map-pin-pink.svg" mode="aspectFit" /><view><text>会提醒什么</text><text>当关注地点出现新的、已核对的版面记录或状态更新时，好版地图会整理成可查看的线索。它不是实时库存提醒。</text></view></view><view class="method-card light-capsule"><image src="/assets/icons/bell-pink.svg" mode="aspectFit" /><view><text>当前状态</text><text>V1 先保留这个说明入口。真实提醒设置、账号授权与通知能力将在 V2 的好版地图中接入。</text></view></view><button class="ghost-button subpage-wide-action" bindtap="onBackToMy">返回我的</button></scroll-view></view>

  <view wx:elif="{{currentView === 'method'}}" class="page subpage" data-testid="page-method"><view class="subpage-header"><button class="back-button" bindtap="onBackToMy"><image class="icon icon--back" src="/assets/icons/arrow-left-gray.svg" mode="aspectFit" /></button><text class="subpage-title">隐私与数据</text></view><scroll-view class="method-scroll" scroll-y scroll-top="{{methodScrollTop}}" data-scroll-key="methodScrollTop" bindscrollend="onRememberScrollEnd"><view class="method-card light-capsule"><image src="/assets/icons/calculator-pink.svg" mode="aspectFit" /><view><text>怎么算</text><text>系统基于当前余票，采用超几何分布模型实时计算。不包含玄学或保底暗示。</text></view></view><view class="method-card light-capsule"><image src="/assets/icons/image-pink.svg" mode="aspectFit" /><view><text>照片怎么用</text><text>版面照片和赏票照片都只用于当次识别或核验，终态后删除，不形成长期图片记录。</text></view></view><view class="method-card light-capsule"><image src="/assets/icons/database-pink.svg" mode="aspectFit" /><view><text>记录放在哪里</text><text>待上传草稿保存在当前设备；确认后的结构化版面、位置和核对状态归属您的私有云端账号，V1 不公开地图。</text></view></view><text class="unofficial-note">ICHI 是非官方的记录与计算工具，不代表一番赏品牌方、门店或实时库存。</text><button class="danger-action" bindtap="onClearAllLocalData"><image src="/assets/icons/trash-pink.svg" mode="aspectFit" /><text>删除全部本地数据</text></button><view class="subpage-actions method-actions"><button class="action-button inline-action" bindtap="onBackToStart">返回票池</button><button class="ghost-button" bindtap="onOpenLocalRecords">管理记录</button></view></scroll-view></view>

