  <view wx:elif="{{currentView === 'storage-fallback'}}" class="page state-page" data-testid="page-storage-fallback"><view class="state-card state-card--hero exception-card light-capsule"><view class="round-symbol round-symbol--exception"><image src="/assets/icons/database-white.svg" mode="aspectFit" /></view><text class="state-title">暂时无法读取存储状态</text><text class="card-copy">现有记录没有被删除。可以返回管理本机记录，或回到当前一番赏版面后重试。</text><view class="state-actions"><button class="ghost-button" bindtap="onOpenLocalRecords">管理记录</button><button wx:if="{{activeDraft}}" class="ghost-button" bindtap="onReturnToDraw">回到一番赏版面</button><button wx:else class="ghost-button" bindtap="onBackToMy">返回我的</button></view></view></view>

