  <view wx:if="{{modalView === 'capture-permission-required'}}" class="modal-layer" catchtap="onBlockTap" role="dialog" aria-label="需要拍摄权限"><view class="modal-card modal-card--exception exception-card light-capsule"><view class="round-symbol round-symbol--exception"><image src="/assets/icons/warning-white.svg" mode="aspectFit" /></view><text class="state-title">需要拍摄权限</text><text class="card-copy">拍摄版面需要相机和当前位置。首次允许后，微信会记住授权状态；后续拍摄不会重复询问。</text><view class="state-actions"><button class="ghost-button" bindtap="onOpenCapturePermissionSettings">前往设置</button><button class="text-button" bindtap="onCloseModal">稍后再试</button></view></view></view>

